  silhouette for the status bar; mipmap/ic_launcher renders as a solid
  white square on Android 5+ which is a Play Vitals quality issue. This
  drawable is tinted by the system to either pure white (status bar) or to
  the value declared in `notification_color` meta-data (notification body).
  Shape: simplified radar mark (two concentric arcs + sweep) matching the
  FiyatRadar brand wordmark.
-->
